# Word + number lines: sum the squares of every sorcerer's grade.
#
# A `word` hole makes the template fall back to the regex path (int-only
# templates compile to a hand-rolled scanner); field access and arithmetic
# happen in the Map Each lambda.
#
#   domain examples/04_grade_points.domain
#   Expected output: 552
Cursed Energy: 04_grade_points.input
Cursed Technique: Split Text by "\n"
Cursed Technique: Match Pattern
    Using: "{name:word} grade {g:int}"
Cursed Technique: Map Each
    Using: (r) -> r.g * r.g
Maximum Technique: Sum
Reveal: stdout
